<title>UK: ABN AMRO warrants on Koninklijke Ahold.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO warrants on Koninklijke Ahold.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank NV has issued 1.5 million American-style call warrants, on Koninklijke Ahold NV, lead manager ABN AMRO Bank (Schweiz) said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    102.20 DFL		PREMIUM	11.90 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     9.00 SFR		  GEARING	8.40 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 29.NOV.96-28.APR.98   PAYDATE	28.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  102.20 DFL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
